    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of the state highway system as the \"Lieutenant Michael M. McGreevy, Jr. Memorial Bridge\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S7428",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7428-2015",
